# Build output
build/
build-*/
build-apps/
build-check/
build-real/
build-verify/
out/
cmake-build-*/

# Phase 4: cloned + built dependencies (whisper.cpp, llama.cpp) and their install
# prefix, fetched by scripts/setup_deps. Large; rebuilt from source, never committed.
third_party/

# Phase 11: real-engine test assets + whisper.cpp source build, produced locally by
# scripts/fetch_real_engine_assets.sh and the README's local instructions. Large,
# checksum-verified on fetch; never committed (the models are downloaded, not stored).
.real-engine-assets/
.whisper-install/
whisper.cpp/

# Phase 12: tiny-LLM test model + llama.cpp source build/install, produced locally by
# scripts/fetch_real_engine_assets.sh (llm.gguf filter) and the README's local
# instructions. Large, checksum-verified on fetch; never committed.
.real-llm-assets/
.llama-install/
llama.cpp/

# Phase 3: downloaded local model files (multi-GB; never committed) and run logs.
# Keep the models/ directory structure and its README, but not the weights.
models/**
!models/
!models/README.md
!models/faces/
!models/faces/.gitkeep
latency_log.csv
demo_out.txt

# Phase 15: the on-device memory store written at runtime (people/reminders/events)
# plus SQLite's WAL/SHM sidecars. On-device data — never committed. The vendored
# SQLite SOURCE (memory/vendor/sqlite3/) IS tracked; only the runtime .db is not.
echo_memory.db
echo_memory.db-wal
echo_memory.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Phase 16: the per-device memory-encryption key and the atomic-write temp. The key
# file MUST NEVER be committed — it decrypts the store. The tracked plaintext MIGRATION
# fixture (tests/fixtures/*.db) is intentionally NOT ignored; only these runtime
# sidecars are. (tests/fixtures/ is force-un-ignored below if needed.)
*.db.key
echo_memory.db.tmp
*.db.tmp

# Phase 5: real third-party credentials and cached OAuth tokens. NEVER commit
# these. `.env` holds API keys/secrets; `.echo-tokens/` holds access/refresh
# tokens written by the token store. Only `.env.example` (no real values) is tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.echo-tokens/
*.env
!.env.example
# stray test artifacts
appkit_test.env

# CMake
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/
*.cmake.stamp

# Compiled artifacts
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe

# Phase 8: static-analysis / fuzzing / coverage outputs. All regenerated by CI or a
# local run; never committed. The fuzz HARNESS and seed corpus under
# apps/appkit/fuzz/ ARE tracked — only the growing corpus and crash reproducers are
# ignored.
coverage/
*.gcov
*.gcda
*.gcno
cppcheck_local.txt
fuzz-artifacts/
fuzz-corpus/
crash-*
crash_*
timeout-*
oom-*

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
